WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open the correct week in Sales → Weekly report.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Step 2: Choose Labour to enter named hours × hourly rate lines, or R&amp;O to enter named quantity × unit cost lines.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Step 3: Add, edit or remove the relevant entries. Use Record no cost when the category is a confirmed zero.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Step 4: Review the calculated totals and press Save weekly report.
